       81       field ContractID    as integer
       82       field ContractNum   as character
       83       field vat-type      as character
       84       field tot-transp    as decimal
       85       field tot-other     as decimal
       86       field wrkr          as integer
       87       field agnt          as integer
       88       field boss          as integer
       89       field pay-code      as integer
       90       field discnt-type   as character
